past.employee_description:
ClickTale is a leading Internet company in web analytics. ClickTale’s Customer Experience Analytics (CEA) software helps users optimize the usability and maximize conversion rates of their websites. The company's SaaS products deliver actionable insights and statistical analyses through visualizations of in-page behavior, including playable videos of browsing sessions and multilayered heatmaps.
* Create sales opportunities for new accounts for US small and medium businesses (website owners) by inbound leads generated from marketing efforts, downloads and tradeshows;
* Consult with prospects primarily via phone, email, and video calls, configuring ClickTale software and the user’s online platform based upon traffic and required needs for a customized solution;
* Prepare and deliver live product demos and webinars to prospects;
* Responsible for building sales pipeline and execute sales by exceeding monthly targets.

Vedika, a software development house having the world reputed Financial Accounts package names "FACT". Has international operation; 

Established a Channel network of the products of the organisation. 

Started with direct marketing activities & promoted as Asst. Manager - Channel Development.
